  "tips": [
    "Think before you press. Press, wait half a second, then speak.",
    "Call format: \"[Their call sign], THIS IS [your call sign], OVER.\" Message: \"[call sign], [message], OVER.\"",
    "Speak slowly and clearly, normal volume, microphone a few centimetres from your mouth.",
    "Read numbers digit by digit using the radio figures (WUN, TOO, TREE, FOW-ER, FIFE, SIX, SEV-EN, AIT, NIN-ER, ZE-RO).",
    "Spell names, registration numbers and grid letters with the phonetic alphabet (\"I SPELL\").",
    "Ask for a READ BACK of anything critical: locations, numbers, times, casualty details."
